# Vue frontend (`wsjtx-web-ui`)

- Real app entry: `App.vue` → `HomeView` → `BandActivity` / `ControlPanel` / `WaterfallDisplay`.
- State and WS live in `src/stores/wsjtx.ts`. Prefer typed messages over `any` when touching the store.
- Wire types today: `"1"` status, `"2"` decode; commands: `reply`, `halt`, `getAudioDevices`, `setAudioDevice`.
- Ignore / delete scaffold leftovers when touching UI: `HelloWorld`, `TheWelcome`, `WelcomeItem`, icon pack, `stores/counter.ts`, `AboutView` (see purge todo).
- Vite build writes to `../dist` for Go embed. Dev: `npm run dev` on `:5173`.
- Do not add new heavy Node deps without need; long-term direction may leave the SPA (see frontend migration todo).
